              <Div Class="Field Field--Name-Field-Psa-Recall-Product-Desc Field--Type-Text-Long Field--Label-Above Clearfix Text-Formatted">
    <H3 Class="Field__Label">Product Description</H3>
              <Div Class="Field__Item"><P>Children’S Finger-Painting Kits<Br>
Kits Include:</P>

<Ul>
<Li>Round Paint Palette</Li>
<Li>Colouring Books</Li>
</Ul>
</Div>
          </Div>
  <Div Class="Field Field--Name-Field-Psa-Recall-Product-Defects Field--Type-Text-Long Field--Label-Above Clearfix Text-Formatted">
    <H3 Class="Field__Label">Reason The Product Is Recalled</H3>
              <Div Class="Field__Item"><P>The Finger-Painting Kits Contain Hazardous And Toxic Substances, Methanol, Ethylene Glycol And A Phthalate.</P>
</Div>
          </Div>
  <Div Class="Field Field--Name-Field-Psa-Recall-Hazards Field--Type-Text-Long Field--Label-Above Clearfix Text-Formatted">
    <H3 Class="Field__Label">The Hazards To Consumers</H3>
              <Div Class="Field__Item"><P>Risk Of Serious Health Effects Including Death If Children Ingest The Finger-Paint. There Is A Risk Of Skin Irritation And Swollen Lymph Nodes From Contact With The Finger-Paint.<Br>
<Br>
Incidents Have Occurred Overseas.</P>
</Div>
          </Div>
  <Div Class="Field Field--Name-Field-Psa-Recall-Consumer-Action Field--Type-Text-Long Field--Label-Above Clearfix Text-Formatted">
    <H3 Class="Field__Label">What Consumers Should Do</H3>
              <Div Class="Field__Item"><Ol>
<Li>Stop Using The Finger Paint Immediately And Keep Out Of Reach Of Children.</Li>
<Li>Write “Recalled” On The Back And Lid Of The Finger-Paint Pad And Submit A Photograph Of The Marked Product To <A Href="Mailto:Info@Thekiddospace.Com ">Info@Thekiddospace.Com </A>To Receive A Full Refund.</Li>
<Li>Dispose Of The Toys Once The Photograph Is Submitted In Accordance With Local Waste Disposal Requirements.</Li>
<Li>Contact Thekiddospace For Further Information Relating To The Recall Or For Further Assistance.</Li>
</Ol>

<H3>Contact</H3>

<P>Thekiddospace<Br>
Email: <A Href="Mailto:Info@Thekiddospace.Com">Info@Thekiddospace.Com</A><Br>
Visit: <A Href="Https://Thekiddospace.Shop">Https://Thekiddospace.Shop</A></P>
</Div>
